{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1468799-princess-the-hopeful-unknown-courts","id":1468799,"title":"Princess: The Hopeful, unknown Courts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-24T17:54:14-08:00","id":1468799,"title":"Princess: The Hopeful, unknown Courts","content":"So earlier I was reading a supplement to Princess: The Hopeful (The Court of Dice, specifically) &amp; I came across references to some Courts that I can't find anywhere in full. So I'm wondering, does anyone have any information on these Courts?<br /> <br /> They are: the Court of Chords, the Court of Mists, the Court of Petals, the Court of Poppies, the Court of Scythes, the Court of Serpents, &amp; the Court of Stars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26055-krat05","name":"Krat05","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-24T18:02:28-08:00","id":1468800,"title":"","content":"Those are Twilight versions/offshoots of the Radiant Courts in the main book - a counterpart to &quot;Road of Dawn&quot;. Ask on the Princess Discord server for details; I don't think they're quite finished yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1133-michael-brazier","name":"Michael Brazier","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-24T20:23:16-08:00","id":1468810,"title":"","content":"Can you post the link to the Discord? I like Princess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-24T20:43:54-08:00","id":1468811,"title":"","content":"Sure!<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/55HvaA4K\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/55HvaA4K\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/55HvaA4K\" target=\"_blank\"> https://discord.gg/55HvaA4K </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Here\u2019s the server link for the PtH Discord server,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27083-truemrmultiverse","name":"TrueMrMultiverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27083_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-26T18:12:18-08:00","id":1468937,"title":"","content":"Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-01T12:29:35-08:00","id":1469348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krat05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1468799-princess-the-hopeful-unknown-courts#post1468799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So earlier I was reading a supplement to Princess: The Hopeful (The Court of Dice, specifically) &amp; I came across references to some Courts that I can't find anywhere in full. So I'm wondering, does anyone have any information on these Courts?<br /> <br /> They are: the Court of Chords, the Court of Mists, the Court of Petals, the Court of Poppies, the Court of Scythes, the Court of Serpents, &amp; the Court of Stars.</div> </div> </div> </div>YAY! Someone actually cares about my Court of Dice!<br /> <br /> For context:<br /> Chords, Petals, Mists, Poppies, Scythes, and Stars are 'Dusk Courts'. If Cups, Pentacles, and Wands are 'what if the Tears, Mirrors, and Storms respectively didn't fall'. Chords, Petals, Poppies, Scythes, and Stars are what if some Radiant Courts did.<br /> <br /> Chords is what if Spades fell. They're basically a hive mind, though not hyper aggressive about recruiting. They have an insular streak.<br /> <br /> Petals is the Queen of Hearts going nuts. Good news, she can make Madoka-style wish contracts, getting ordinary people to blossom. The bad news is... they're Madoka style contracts. Hi, ho inevitable dethroning. Petals Nobles are actually good people, but they're even more self-sacrificing than normal nobles.<br /> <br /> Poppies... is drug dealing ex-Clubs. They more or less have given up, and are trying to numb the pain through pleasure.<br /> <br /> Scythes and Stars are BOTH fallen Swords. Scythes is something an old consort of the Queen of Swords started after a coup. I AM THE LAW! They're pretty harsh lawgivers, ruthless punishers.Their invocation sacrifices their emotions... and lets them rip the emotions out of others to replace them. Stars meanwhile, is the Court of Yandere, started by the actual ex-Queen of Swords.<br /> <br /> Mists is basically all about being the masquerade. It's ran by... Plato. Who usurped the Queen of Diamonds. Plato is an owl, by the way.<br /> <br /> Serpents is the only one in that list that isn't a Dusk Court, and it's basically Storms-lite. It's basically the court that lets you learn things the hard way, and then makes sure you learned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25382-tzauri","name":"Tzauri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T03:04:57-08:00","id":1470836,"title":"","content":"Will they be added to the \u2018official\u2019 list of Princess PDFs? Be cause I\u2019d really like to read up on them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link